## 5. 💻 Payloads & Cheat Sheet

### 5.1 Harmless detection examples

Use these only on your own application, an authorized target, or a training lab.

| Probe | Purpose | Expected interpretation |
|---|---|---|
| `ssti_probe_123` | Baseline marker | Shows ordinary reflection |
| `{{7*7}}` | Arithmetic evaluation | `49` suggests compatible expression evaluation |
| `${7*7}` | Alternate syntax | `49` may indicate a compatible engine |
| `a{{7*7}}b` | Observe evaluation within surrounding text | `a49b` suggests evaluation in that context |

These probes are not universal. Some engines do not support arithmetic in these contexts, and some applications alter input before rendering.

